-- profiling: always high-risk
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system high-risk under Article 6(2) and (3) with Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not referred to in Annex III
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system high-risk under Article 6(2) and (3) with Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
