-- Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither?
-- an Annex I product: a safety component of a medical device, asked on 2 August 2028
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
-- an Annex III system asked on 2 December 2027: Article 6(1) does not yet apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither` (Date 2 12 2027) (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I no listed legislation` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
-- neither paragraph makes the system high-risk, asked on 2 August 2028
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I no listed legislation` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Route neither`
-- asked the day before Chapter III applies to either route: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither` (Date 1 12 2027) (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I no listed legislation` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- high-risk under both paragraphs: the Annex III route, from the earlier date
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
-- an Annex I product whose component is a safety component only through its intended purpose (Article 3(14), as amended): the definition's own facts
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
-- the part is not a component of a product or of an AI system, so not a safety component (Article 3(14)): neither paragraph
#ASSERT `Under Article 6, as a provider of an AI system, by which route is my AI system high-risk under Article 6: Article 6(1) with Annex I, Article 6(2) with Annex III, or neither` (Date 2 8 2028) (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Route neither`

