§ `Under Annex III: the high-risk areas`

-- Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)?
-- no fact of the area is true
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- a system the area lists
#ASSERT `Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE
-- the carve-out or the 'in so far as' limit of the point
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- a remote biometric identification system by the definition's own facts (Article 3(41))
#ASSERT `Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- not comparing against a reference database, so not a remote biometric identification system (Article 3(41)): not listed
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- a biometric verification (Article 3(36)) whose sole purpose is to confirm that a person is who they claim to be: 'This shall not include'
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- not one-to-one, so not a biometric verification (Article 3(36)): the exclusion does not apply
#ASSERT `Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- biometric categorisation by sensitive attributes: the definition's own facts (Article 3(40))
#ASSERT `Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
-- ancillary to another commercial service and strictly necessary: not a biometric categorisation system (Article 3(40)): not listed
#ASSERT NOT (`Under Annex III point 1, as a provider of an AI system, is my AI system listed in point 1 of Annex III (biometrics, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)

