-- P2-cases-seat-provider.l4: cases for every question of P2-seat-provider.l4, with the facts a real a provider of an AI system would state. Expected values are written by hand from the text.

§ `The role and the applicability of the provisions`

-- develops an AI system and places it on the market under its own name
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, am I a provider within the meaning of Article 3(3)` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- has one developed and puts it into service under its own name
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, am I a provider within the meaning of Article 3(3)` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- develops and places it on the market, but not under its own name or trademark
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, am I a provider within the meaning of Article 3(3)` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- neither develops nor has one developed
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, am I a provider within the meaning of Article 3(3)` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- the day before Chapter I applies (Art 113(a): 2 February 2025)
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 2 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day Chapter I begins to apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 2 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the first day of the text as amended
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): they do not apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 1 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day they begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an Annex I system on 2 December 2027: its date is 2 August 2028 (Art 113(c)(ii))
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before they apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2028) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day they begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2028) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- placed earlier and not significantly changed: saved by Article 111(2)
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- placed earlier and significantly changed since: covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a system that is not high-risk: no date of application, they do not apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a provider of an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route neither` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


