#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 1, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a general description of the AI system including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the versions of relevant software or firmware, and any requirements related to version updates
#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 1, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a general description of the AI system including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the description of all the forms in which the AI system is placed on the market or put into service, such as software packages embedded into hardware, downloads, or APIs
#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 1, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a general description of the AI system including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the technical documentation contains the description of the hardware on which the AI system is intended to run
