#ASSERT `Under Annex IV point 1, as a provider of an AI system, does the technical documentation of my high-risk AI system contain a general description of the AI system including the eight items the point lists` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
