-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was `#ASSERT `Under Article 44(2), as a provider of an AI system, is the period the certificate indicates within the limit` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE FALSE 5 EQUALS NOTHING`; the caller no longer counts whole years: the certificate's first and last day of validity are two dates and the period is computed from them (fork F-44-2-period), so the question asks for the two dates and not for a number of years; the case is given by the dates that make the same period, the answer is unchanged
-- Before the group applies (1 August 2026): not covered.
